 multiplayer\n- 4 Multi Play Stage\n- Separate single-player mode and stage\n- 8 Single Play Stage\n- Blitzer, Blitzmon customizing\n- Minigame with Blitzmon", "short_description": "\u6a5f\u7532\u64ca\u6230\u662f\u4e00\u6b3e\u4ee5\u5feb\u901f\u79fb\u52d5\u548c\u591a\u7a2e\u6280\u80fd\u70ba\u57fa\u790e\u7684\u5718\u968a\u5c0d\u6230FPS\u904a\u6232\u3002\u5c07\u8207\u5354\u52a9\u81ea\u5df1\u7684AI\u6230\u9b25\u52a9\u624b\u300c\u8fc5\u6230\u6a5f\u7378\u300d\u548c\u5f37\u5927\u706b\u529b\u7684\u4e58\u5750\u5f0f\u6230\u9b25\u6a5f\u300c\u5de8\u68b0\u300d\u4e00\u540c\u4e3b\u5bb0\u6230\u5834\uff01"}, {"images": {"nodes": []}, "id": "892896565869614", "locale": "en_GB", "screenshots": [], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Strike Rush", "keywords": ["shooting", "action", "multi", "gun", "fps"], "long_description": "Strike Rush is a team-based FPS battle game with fast paced movement and a variety of abilities. Dominate the battleground with the AI battle assistant, \"Blitzmon\" and the powerful firepower of the ridable battle vehicle, \"Colossus!\"\n\n- 4:4 team multiplayer\n- 4 Multi Play Stage\n- Separate single-player mode and stage\n- 8 Single Play Stage\n- Blitzer, Blitzmon customizing\n- Minigame with Blitzmon", "short_description": "Strike Rush is a team-based FPS battle game with fast paced movement and a variety of abilities. Dominate the battleground with the AI battle assistant, \"Blitzmon\" and the powerful firepower of the ridable battle vehicle, \"Colossus!\""}, {"images": {"nodes": []}, "id": "757890046262703", "locale": "ko_KR", "screenshots": [], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Strike Rush", "keywords": ["fps", "shooting", "action", "multi", "gun"], "long_description": "\uc2a4\ud2b8\ub77c\uc774\ud06c \ub7ec\uc2dc\ub294 \ube60\ub978 \uc774\ub3d9\uacfc \ub2e4\uc591\ud55c \uc2a4\ud0ac\uc744 \uae30\ubc18\uc73c\ub85c \ud558\ub294 \ud300 \ub300\uc804 FPS \uac8c\uc784\uc785\ub2c8\ub2e4. \